abstract: |
  The community-standards repository provides a baseline set of governance documents, templates,
  and contribution workflows to help projects adopt consistent, maintainable, and collaborative
  open-source practices. Version 2.0.0 updates these standards for AI-assisted and AI agent-driven
  development: it defines AI involvement levels from human-authored to fully automated, requires
  transparent disclosure of AI use and human accountability for every contribution, adds
  instructions for AI coding agents (AGENTS.md), and upgrades the code of conduct to
  Contributor Covenant 3.0.
